  "title": "New AURORA 1 Analysis: LUPKYNIS-Based Triple Immunosuppressive Therapy Yields Deep Proteinuria Reduction in Lupus Nephritis",
  "summary": "ROCKVILLE, Md. & EDMONTON, Alberta--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Aurinia Pharmaceuticals Inc. (NASDAQ: AUPH) (Aurinia or the Company), today announced that a post-hoc analysis of the 52-week, Phase 3 AURORA 1 study showed that lupus nephritis (LN) patients who received triple immunosuppressive therapy with LUPKYNIS® (voclosporin), mycophenolate mofetil (MMF), and low-dose glucocorticoids achieved lower proteinuria targets at substantially higher rates compared to patients in the control group who received mycophenolate mofetil (MMF) and low-dose glucocorticoids alone.",
